potatoes]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] fresh [[Cookbook:Pea|peas]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]], diced\n*½–¾ cup [[Cookbook:Mayonnaise|mayonnaise]]\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]] to taste\n==Procedure==\n# Cook all vegetables separately until tender, but not too soft.\n# Allow to cool completely.\n# Dress with mayonnaise, salt, and pepper.\n# Serve as a side dish.\n\n== Notes, tips, and mayonnaise ==\n\n* Please note that the mayonnaise used for this dish should not be sweet.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peas]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for potato salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mayonnaise]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Ensalada Rusa (Uruguayan Potato Salad)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 large potatoes, diced","sourceText":"2 large potatoes, diced","amountText":"2 large potatoes, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup fresh peas","sourceText":"1 cup fresh peas","amountText":"1 cup fresh peas","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 carrots, diced","sourceText":"2 carrots, diced","amountText":"2 carrots, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½–¾ cup mayonnaise","sourceText":"½–¾ cup mayonnaise","amountText":"½–¾ cup mayonnaise","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Salt to taste","sourceText":"Salt to taste","amountText":"Salt to taste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Pepper to taste","sourceText":"Pepper to taste","amountText":"Pepper to taste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Cook all vegetables separately until tender, but not too soft.","sourceText":"Cook all vegetables separately until t